OL,3,AOpenAI scraps rollout of new model over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI will not release its
OL,7,Fnext-generation model - GPT-6.1 Astra -
OL,8,Fdue to safety concerns, the
OL,9,FChatGPT-maker confirmed on Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe AI system - which performs tasks
OL,12,Flike browsing the web and using apps by
OL,13,Fitself - "didn't quite meet the bar" of
OL,14,Fthe company's standards, Saachi Jain,
OL,15,Fhead of safety systems at OpenAI, said.
OL,17,FIn recent weeks, top AI leaders
OL,18,Fincluding OpenAI's Sam Altman and
OL,19,FAnthropic boss Dario Amodei have urged
OL,20,Fthe industry to slow the pace of
OL,21,Fdevelopment due to concerns about risks
OL,22,Fassociated with the technology.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
